3. HBase Use Case: Customer 360 / Customer Profile

//Business problem
A telecom company has millions of customers. It needs very fast lookup of a customer's:
Customer ID
Name
City
Mobile number
Plan
Status
Data usage


HBase is suitable because customer information can be retrieved quickly using a Customer ID as the row key.

//Flow
Application
    |
    | Customer ID
    v
+----------------------+
|        HBase         |
|                      |
| customer_profiles    |
|                      |
| RowKey = CUST1001    |
| RowKey = CUST1002    |
| RowKey = CUST1003    |
+----------------------+
    |
    v
Fast customer lookup


//USE THESE:

| HBase Command | Purpose                |

| create      | Create table           |
| put         | Insert / update data   |
| get         | Read one row           |
| scan        | Read multiple rows     |
| delete      | Delete a column        |
| deleteall   | Delete a row           |
| count       | Count rows             |
| describe    | Display table metadata |
| disable     | Disable table          |
| drop        | Remove table           |


